<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Release notes: oganesson & tennessine</title>
<meta name="description" content="What changed in each release of oganesson and tennessine, newest first, with an RSS feed per browser.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Release notes: oganesson & tennessine">
<meta property="og:description" content="What changed in each release of oganesson and tennessine, newest first, with an RSS feed per browser.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0b10">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://dubna.zakius.xyz/releases.html">
<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="oganesson and tennessine releases" href="releases.xml">
<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="oganesson releases" href="releases-oganesson.xml">
<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="tennessine releases" href="releases-tennessine.xml">
<link rel="icon" href="img/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<style>
:root{--bg:#0a0b10;--bg2:#11131b;--card:#151824;--line:#252a3a;--text:#e8e9f0;--dim:#9aa0b4;--faint:#8288a0;
  --og:#ff9a5a;--ts:#b48cff;--glow:linear-gradient(100deg,#ffb36b 0%,#ff7fa8 45%,#a78bff 100%);
  --mono:ui-monospace,"JetBrains Mono","SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,monospace;--sans:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Inter,Roboto,sans-serif}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:80px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:15px/1.55 var(--sans);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
nav{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;height:56px;max-width:1240px}
nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--dim);font-size:14px} nav a:hover{color:var(--text)}
nav b{font-family:var(--mono);white-space:nowrap}
header{padding:48px 0 28px}
h1{font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,52px);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.05}
h1 em{font-style:normal;background:var(--glow);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.lede{color:var(--dim);margin:0;font-size:17px}
.feeds{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px;align-items:center;color:var(--faint);font-size:13.5px}
.feeds a{font:12.5px var(--mono);padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);text-decoration:none;color:var(--dim)}
.feeds a:hover{color:var(--text);border-color:#3b4260}
.bar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:4;background:rgba(10,11,16,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 0}
.seg{display:inline-flex;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:3px}
.seg button{all:unset;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:7px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--dim)}
.seg button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--card);color:var(--text)}
main{padding:28px 24px 80px}
.rel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:14px}
.rel .head{display:flex;gap:10px 14px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap}
.rel h2{font-size:17px;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.005em}
.rel h2 a{text-decoration:none}
.rel h2 a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.rel time{margin-left:auto;font:12.5px var(--mono);color:var(--faint);white-space:nowrap}
.b{font:11.5px var(--mono);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}
.b.og{color:var(--og);border-color:rgba(255,154,90,.35)} .b.ts{color:var(--ts);border-color:rgba(180,140,255,.35)}
.notes{color:var(--dim);font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px}
.notes p{margin:6px 0}
.notes ul{margin:6px 0;padding-left:20px}
.notes li{margin:3px 0}
.notes code{font:12px var(--mono);color:var(--faint)}
.notes a{text-decoration-color:var(--line)}
.rel .gh{font:12.5px var(--mono);color:var(--faint);text-decoration:none}
.rel .gh:hover{color:var(--text)}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
.skip{position:absolute;left:12px;top:-60px;z-index:10;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.skip:focus{top:10px}
a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ts);outline-offset:2px}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
@media (max-width:600px){.rel time{margin-left:0;flex-basis:100%}}
footer{padding:40px 0 60px;color:var(--faint);font-size:13.5px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:1240px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<nav><div class="wrap"><a href="index.html">← <b>oganesson · tennessine</b></a><span style="flex:1"></span><a href="install.html">Install</a><a href="everything.html">Everything</a></div></nav>
<header><div class="wrap">
  <h1>Release <em>notes</em></h1>
  <p class="lede">What changed in each release of both browsers, newest first: the latest __SHOWN__ of each. Every line is one change, linked to its commit; each release's packages are on GitHub. A browser updates to its newest release through its repository; <a href="install.html">Install</a> says how.</p>
  <div class="feeds">RSS: <a href="releases-oganesson.xml">oganesson</a><a href="releases-tennessine.xml">tennessine</a><a href="releases.xml">both</a></div>
</div></header>

<div class="bar" hidden><div class="wrap">
  <div class="seg" id="br" role="group" aria-label="Browser"><button data-v="all" aria-pressed="true">Both</button><button data-v="og" aria-pressed="false">oganesson</button><button data-v="ts" aria-pressed="false">tennessine</button></div>
</div></div>

<main id="main" class="wrap">__RELEASES__</main>

<footer><div class="wrap">
  <span>oganesson · tennessine · dubna. Built on Helium, ungoogled-chromium, Vanadium, Titanium, Brave's importer and Chromium. Thank you all.</span>
  <span>Licenses: oganesson GPL-3.0-only · tennessine GPL-2.0-only · dubna GPL-2.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only.</span>
</div></footer>

<script>
// The build writes every release into the page, so it reads in full without JS; this only
// filters by browser.
document.querySelector('.bar').hidden=false;
const buttons=document.querySelectorAll('#br button');
buttons.forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{
  buttons.forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',x===b));
  for(const r of document.querySelectorAll('.rel'))r.hidden=b.dataset.v!=='all'&&r.dataset.b!==b.dataset.v;
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
